    "introduction": "Investec provides specialist banking and wealth-related services, with a strong presence in South Africa and the UK. Its clients include businesses, entrepreneurs, professionals and other private customers needing lending, savings, transactional services and financial expertise. Revenue comes from interest and fees, with the mix varying across its banking and investment-related activities. Rather than relying only on a mass-market branch model, it emphasises specialist capabilities and client relationships. Credit quality, funding costs and customer activity influence earnings. The group's cross-market structure also brings currency and regulatory considerations, while capital management and disciplined lending are important to sustaining its financial services operations.",
